  "description": "The 3pt drawbar is made of stainless steel with an Orange finish surface. Widely used in heavy-duty work in industrial, warehouse, and construction businesses.\nFitment\nSuitable for Category 1 Tractors.\nFeatures\nSuitable for Category 1 Tractors\nThe tractor drawbar is designed for 3 points 1 category tractors, it can be fitted with a suitcase, which acts as a ballast tank to add weight to the rear of your tractor, preventing the tractor from tipping over.\nConvenient 2\" Trailer Receiver\nThe 3 Point hitch receiver has a 2-inch receiver hitch, which can tow a variety of trailer vehicles to help you loosen the ground or haul heavy loads.\nQuick Disassembly Design\nThis 3-point receiver drawbar helps change the device at the rear of the tractor for easy and quick assembly and disassembly, widely used in heavy-duty work of industrial, warehouse, and construction businesses.\nDurable Material\nThe 3pt drawbar is made of stainless steel, the structure is strong and durable, and the surface is Orange powder coated to prevent rust and corrosion.",
